<p data-node-id="I862:15947;756:1467" data-part="paragraph" class="current-lede">The Hearth is a round room with heated stone in it, a sauna on one side and a cold plunge on the other. Transducers are built into the benches and the structure, so a low note arrives in your back before you hear it. Most of a session is going between the heat and the cold, and most people are quiet in there without being told to be.</p>
<p data-part="paragraph" class="current-lede">It is a five-minute walk from the villas and about [x] minutes from the tents, downhill one way.</p></div>
<div data-part="rate"><p data-node-id="I862:15947;756:1469" data-part="eyebrow">Sessions</p>
